{'symbol': 'ALLE', 'date': '2021-10-21 05:30:00', 'title': 'ALLEGION REPORTS THIRD-QUARTER 2021 FINANCIAL RESULTS, REAFFIRMS UPDATED FULL-YEAR 2021 OUTLOOK', 'text': 'DUBLIN--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ALLEGION PLC (NYSE: ALLE), A LEADING GLOBAL PROVIDER OF SECURITY PRODUCTS AND SOLUTIONS, TODAY REPORTED THIRD-QUARTER 2021 NET REVENUES OF $717 MILLION AND NET EARNINGS OF $143.5 MILLION, OR $1.59 PER SHARE. EXCLUDING CHARGES RELATED TO RESTRUCTURING AND ACQUISITION AND INTEGRATION, AS WELL AS A GAIN ON THE SALE OF AN EQUITY METHOD INVESTMENT, ADJUSTED NET EARNINGS WERE $140.7 MILLION, OR $1.56 PER SHARE, DOWN 6.6 PERCENT WHEN COMPARED WITH THIRD-QUARTER 2020 ADJUSTED E'}